    id: '395', slug: 'presto', title: 'Presto', title_ar: 'بريستو', year: 2008,
    director: 'Doug Sweetland', director_ar: 'Doug Sweetland',
    cast: ['Doug Sweetland'],
    genres: ['animation', 'drama', 'comedy'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/aKDwLqR0JWoLX7dgwje42vCwhBd.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tL7piqWkq8vdmZ83kREf3KRnB3Y.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q1K9EH90CyA',
    description_ar: 'عندما يُهمل الساحر بريستو إطعام أرنبه مراتٍ كثيرة، يكتشف الساحر أنه ليس الوحيد الذي يملك بعض الحيل!',
    description_en: 'Dignity. Poise. Mystery. We expect nothing less from the great turn-of-the-century magician, Presto. But when Presto neglects to feed his rabbit one too many times, the magician finds he isn\'t the only one with a few tricks up his sleeve!',
    description_fr: 'Le spectacle (hilarant) du grand magicien Presto et de son lapin, Alec...',
    description_es: 'Alec es el hambriento conejillo que sufre cada noche la indiferencia del público y la posterior actitud despótica y prepotente de su dueño que no quiere compartir con él la fama. Pero la maldad del mago, haciéndole que sufra con una rica zanahoria inalcanzable, provocará una inesperada venganza inteligente de su \'mascota\' en plena actuación.',
    description_tr: 'Meşhur bir illüzyonistin şapkadan tavşan çıkarma numarası yapması gerekmektedir, gelin görün ki karnı açlıktan gurul gurul eden küçücük bir kafese sıkışmış tavşanımız bu numara için sahibine kök söktürmektedir.',
    description_de: 'Der Zauberer Presto will in seiner Show mit einem magischen Hut den Hasen Alec herbeizaubern, dieser geht aber in eine Art Hungerstreik, und will ohne seine Möhre nicht so recht mitspielen.',
    description_ja: 'Dignity. Poise. Mystery. We expect nothing less from the great turn-of-the-century magician, Presto. But when Presto neglects to feed his rabbit one too many times, the magician finds he isn\'t the only one with a few tricks up his sleeve!',
    description_pt: 'Quando o mágico Presto esquece de alimentar seu coelho Alec, este passa a tramar todo o tipo de sabotagem aos truques do seu mestre.',
    rating_overall: 7.9, rating_story: 7.9, rating_acting: 8, rating_direction: 7.8, rating_cinematography: 7.6, rating_music: 7.4,
