    id: '597', slug: 'barbie-in-the-12-dancing-princesses', title: 'Barbie in the 12 Dancing Princesses', title_ar: 'Barbie in the 12 Dancing Princesses', year: 2006,
    director: 'Greg Richardson', director_ar: 'Greg Richardson',
    cast: ['Kelly Sheridan', 'Catherine O\'Hara', 'Christopher Gaze', 'Nicole Oliver', 'Jennifer Copping', 'Lalainia Lindbjerg'],
    genres: ['animation', 'drama'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/yBB7PwXRFJ29U8m8SnTcWVizFvM.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1KzmjDbhHwBARDzzZZKNC3tqqgd.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c4hwh2KpdtU',
    description_ar: 'King Randolph sends for his cousin, Duchess Rowena, to help turn his daughters, Princess Genevieve and her eleven sisters, into royal material. But the Duchess strips the sisters of their fun, including their favorite pastime: dancing. When all hope may be lost, the sisters discover a secret passageway to a magical land where they can dance the night away.',
    description_en: 'King Randolph sends for his cousin, Duchess Rowena, to help turn his daughters, Princess Genevieve and her eleven sisters, into royal material. But the Duchess strips the sisters of their fun, including their favorite pastime: dancing. When all hope may be lost, the sisters discover a secret passageway to a magical land where they can dance the night away.',
    description_fr: 'Avec ses onze sœurs, Princesse Geneviève découvre un passage secret qui les emmène dans un monde enchanteur fait de danse et de joie, et où les souhaits deviennent réalités. Mais lorsque le roi est en danger, Princesse Geneviève et ses sœurs vont devoir s\'entraider afin de sauver leur père et le royaume. Elles apprennent alors que la solidarité et le pouvoir d\'une famille peut venir à bout de tous les obstacles...',
    description_es: 'Únete a Barbie, en el papel de la bella Princesa Genevieve, y a sus 11 hermanas y princesas bailarinas y descubre con ellas la entrada secreta a un mundo mágico, donde los deseos ise hacen realidad! Pero cuando su padre corre el riesgo de perder su reino, la Princesa Genevieve y sus hermanas deberán unirse para salvarle. Así aprenderán que el poder de la familia es capaz de superar cualquier obstáculo.',
    description_tr: 'Barbie, bu yepyeni eğlenceli ve büyüleyici macerada danslarıyla kalbinizin en derinliklerine kadar ulaşacak. Dileklerin gerçeğe dönüştüğü şaşırtıcı ve sihirli bir dünyanın kapılarını açacak gizemi keşfeden güzel Prenses Genevieve ve onun onbir dans eden prenses kız kardeşlerine siz de katılın! Babalarının krallığının tehlikeye girmesi üzerine Prenses Genevieve ve kız kardeşleri birlik olmak, hem günü hem babalarını kurtarmak için çalışmak zorunda kalacaklardır. Böylece sorunların üstesinden gelmek için aile birliğinin ne kadar önemli olduğunu öğreneceklerdir.',
    description_de: 'Begleite Prinzessin Genevieve und ihre 11 Schwestern in Barbie in Die 12 tanzenden Prinzessinnen auf ihrer Entdeckung eines geheimen Eingangs zu einer magischen verblüffenden Welt, in der alle Wünsche erfüllt werden. Doch als ihr Vater König Rudolf Gefahr läuft, sein Königreich zu verlieren, kämpft Prinzessin Genevieve gegen das Unheil und beweist zum Schluss, dass man mit der Familie alle Hindernisse überwinden kann.',
    description_ja: 'King Randolph sends for his cousin, Duchess Rowena, to help turn his daughters, Princess Genevieve and her eleven sisters, into royal material. But the Duchess strips the sisters of their fun, including their favorite pastime: dancing. When all hope may be lost, the sisters discover a secret passageway to a magical land where they can dance the night away.',
    description_pt: 'No filme Barbie em as 12 Princesas Bailarinas, Barbie irá dançar até te tocar no coração nesta nova aventura recheada de diversão e magia. Mas quando o seu pai se encontra em risco de perder o seu reino, a Princesa Genevieve e as suas irmãs têm de trabalhar em conjunto para salvarem o dia e o seu pai. Elas aprendem que o poder da família pode ultrapassar todos os obstáculos!',
    rating_overall: 7.7, rating_story: 7.7, rating_acting: 7.8, rating_direction: 7.6, rating_cinematography: 7.4, rating_music: 7.2,
    imdb_rating: 7.6, rotten_tomatoes: 76,
