    id: '669', slug: 'undisputed-iii-redemption', title: 'Undisputed III: Redemption', title_ar: 'بلا منازع 3 : الخلاص', year: 2010,
    director: 'Isaac Florentine', director_ar: 'Isaac Florentine',
    cast: ['Scott Adkins', 'Mykel Shannon Jenkins', 'Mark Ivanir', 'Hristo Shopov', 'Marko Zaror', 'Michael Baral'],
    genres: ['action', 'thriller', 'crime'],
    poster_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/g8KB77SPA7SyU8eid6TAEpt9skU.jpg',
    backdrop_url: 'https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fTZlSRATSk7QJyUrpbmjScDtY8Z.jpg',
    trailer_url: 'https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qq-yqajCo6k',
    description_ar: 'تدور قصة الفيلم حول الملاكم الروسي القوي الذي يدعى بويكا، والذي كان يقاتل في احدى النزالات بالسجن وقد كسرت ركبته وخسر، وعلى بويكا أن يستعيد مكانته في نزال جديد.',
    description_en: 'Russian inmate Boyka, now severely hobbled by the knee injury suffered at the end of Undisputed 2. No longer the feared prison fighter he was, he has declined so far that he is now good only for cleaning toilets. But when a new prison fight tournament begins - an international affair, matching the best fighters from prisons around the globe, enticing them with the promise of freedom for the winner - Boyka must reclaim his dignity and fight for his position in the tournament.',
    description_fr: 'Huit combattants d’élite sont réunis dans une même prison par un mystérieux syndicat, qui organise des combats clandestins, avec à la clé : la liberté pour le vainqueur et des millions de dollars de gains pour les organisateurs. Blessé physiquement et moralement par son dernier combat, Boyka débarque dans cet enfer et devra montrer tous ses talents pour conquérir sa liberté.',
    description_es: 'En esta película Scott Adkins vuelve a encarnar a Boyka (el malo de Undisputed 2), que busca la libertad. Cuando se le ofrece la oportunidad de participar en un campeonato clandestino entre los 8 mejores luchadores reclusos del mundo, ni lo dudará.',
    description_tr: 'Maksimum seviyede korunan hapishanede gizli dövüşler düzenlenmektedir Dünyanın dört bir tarafından gelen sekiz özel mahkum ölümcül dövüşlerde mücadele etmektedir Kazanan, ödül olarak özgürlüğüne kavuşacaktır Rus tutuklu Boyka da bu dövüşlere hazırlanmaktadır Dizinden sakatlandığı için işi hiç kolay değildir ama hayatta kalmak için dövüşmekten başka çaresi yoktur...',
    description_de: 'Yuri Boyka ist zurück! Doch der einst gefürchtete Gefängniskämpfer ist nur noch ein Schatten seiner alten Tage. Nach einer schweren Knieverletzung ist er soweit abgestiegen, dass er nur noch zum Toilettenreinigen taugt. Doch dann wird ein internationales Gefängniskämpferturnier ausgetragen. Teilnehmer aus der ganzen Welt treten gegeneinander an und dem Gewinner winkt die Freiheit. Für Boyka die letzte Chance, es doch noch einmal zu beweisen. Doch selbst eine Startberechtigung für das Turnier muss er sich erst erkämpfen.',
    description_ja: 'Russian inmate Boyka, now severely hobbled by the knee injury suffered at the end of Undisputed 2. No longer the feared prison fighter he was, he has declined so far that he is now good only for cleaning toilets. But when a new prison fight tournament begins - an international affair, matching the best fighters from prisons around the globe, enticing them with the promise of freedom for the winner - Boyka must reclaim his dignity and fight for his position in the tournament.',
    description_pt: 'Numa das prisões mais austeras do mundo, os pugilistas mais duros são reunidos para um torneio internacional de Artes Marciais Mistas (MMA, na sigla original). Os combates terão de se manter na clandestinidade. No final, o prémio do vencedor é a liberdade. Aos organizadores é garantido um milhão de dólares. Ferido no último combate e moralmente abatido pelas circunstâncias, Yuri Boyka (Scott Adkins) decide entregar-se de corpo e alma aos treinos, vencer o combate e usar a liberdade para mudar a sua vida. Porém, para que isso seja possível, terá de enfrentar não apenas os seus adversários mas também algo do passado que ficou por resolver.',
    rating_overall: 7.7, rating_story: 7.7, rating_acting: 7.8, rating_direction: 7.6, rating_cinematography: 7.4, rating_music: 7.2,
    imdb_rating: 7.6, rotten_tomatoes: 76,
    budget_million: 3.0,
    box_office_million: 77,
    duration: 96, language: 'EN', country: 'US',
    reviews_count: 4431, is_featured: false, release_date: '2010-04-17', tags: ['action', 'thriller', 'crime', '2010', 'florentine'],
    pros_ar: ['عمق درامي استثنائي', 'أداء تمثيلي رائع', 'قصة إنسانية مؤثرة'],
    cons_ar: ['وتيرة بطيئة في بعض المشاهد', 'يحتاج تركيزاً عالياً'],
